WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:19.600
May what you find here draw you near

2
00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:24.880
To God, and he to you;

3
00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:30.900
His Spirit light your eyes with truth

4
00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:36.860
And guide you all life through.

5
00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:42.780
May all his goodness fill your soul,

6
00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:47.780
Your days be richly blest;

7
00:00:48.640 --> 00:00:55.440
And, trusting him in all your ways,

8
00:00:55.440 --> 00:01:01.400
May you find quiet rest.

9
00:01:02.820 --> 00:01:10.660
May God, who comforts all who mourn,

10
00:01:11.740 --> 00:01:14.440
Make whole what has been torn,

11
00:01:15.280 --> 00:01:21.180
And bind your wounds with tender hands

12
00:01:21.180 --> 00:01:26.500
Till hope again is born.

13
00:01:27.020 --> 00:01:32.680
The LORD in blessing keep you safe

14
00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:38.460
Within his arms of love,

15
00:01:40.620 --> 00:01:43.440
Encircled there eternally

16
00:01:45.120 --> 00:01:49.620
By him who reigns above.

17
00:01:52.180 --> 00:01:57.760
The grace of Jesus Christ our Lord,

18
00:01:57.760 --> 00:02:01.540
The love of God so true,

19
00:02:02.340 --> 00:02:06.900
The Holy Spirit's fellowship

20
00:02:06.900 --> 00:02:10.840
Forever be with you.

21
00:02:37.460 --> 00:02:43.440
May his bright face upon you shine

22
00:02:44.900 --> 00:02:49.040
And gracious be to you;

23
00:02:49.880 --> 00:02:55.680
His favor be upon your life,

24
00:02:56.900 --> 00:03:00.340
His peace your heart renew.

25
00:03:00.340 --> 00:03:07.080
May God, in whom you hope and trust,

26
00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:12.420
Make joy in you increase,

27
00:03:12.420 --> 00:03:18.700
And by his Spirit, hope and faith

28
00:03:19.340 --> 00:03:24.640
And good works never cease.

29
00:03:26.960 --> 00:03:32.980
The Lord enlarge your heart to love

30
00:03:34.500 --> 00:03:38.560
Each soul he shapes, like you;

31
00:03:38.560 --> 00:03:43.880
Through Jesus Christ, of Nazareth,

32
00:03:45.460 --> 00:03:50.300
May you be made anew;

33
00:03:50.300 --> 00:03:56.040
By his atoning grace be brought

34
00:03:57.300 --> 00:04:02.020
With joy through heaven's door,

35
00:04:02.020 --> 00:04:07.100
To rest with him, and glorify

36
00:04:09.300 --> 00:04:13.560
His name forevermore.

37
00:04:15.980 --> 00:04:21.520
The grace of Jesus Christ our Lord,

38
00:04:21.520 --> 00:04:25.240
The love of God so true,

39
00:04:25.240 --> 00:04:30.260
The Holy Spirit's fellowship

40
00:04:30.260 --> 00:04:34.840
Forever be with you.

41
00:04:35.460 --> 00:04:41.540
In the name of Jesus Christ of Nazareth,

42
00:04:47.880 --> 00:04:59.120
Amen, amen, amen.
